# Regenerable outputs. Every figure here is rebuilt from notes/data/*.tsv by a
# script listed in notes/PROVENANCE.md, so the PNG/PDF/SVG themselves are not
# worth 260 MB of history. The source-data TSVs *are* tracked.
notes/figures/
notes/paper/
._*
